      "note": "No public benchmark measures an agent-harness control plane (scheduling runs of headless CLI agents onto pull-based workers), so there is no published score to compare against. The closest public data, the Azure Functions and Alibaba cluster traces, are workloads without an oracle; see BENCHMARKING.md, Datasets."
